Model
- Name: risk-logistic-v1.
- Type: StandardScaler followed by LogisticRegression.
- Training source: an approved historical CSV can be supplied through ML_TRAINING_DATA.
- Current repository state: no approved historical dataset is included; the service uses a clearly labelled synthetic fallback for the hackathon demo.
- The model is not a production credit decision model.

4. Datasets
-----------

No external or personal dataset is included in this repository.

The default demo dataset is generated deterministically in code for smoke tests only. Historical data may be mounted locally at ml-service/data/historical_applications.csv, but that file is ignored by Git and must not contain personal data or confidential banking information.

