6. Simulated integrations
-------------------------

The following integrations are local deterministic simulators. They do not call the real services and do not transmit data to external providers:

- BKI / credit history simulator: backend/app/integrations/bki.py
- EGRUL/EGRIP registry simulator: backend/app/integrations/egrul.py
- FNS Transparent Business simulator: backend/app/integrations/fns.py

The project does not use paid APIs, real credit bureau access, real tax-registry access, or external LLM providers.

